{
  "name": "ondra-dialogue",
  "description": "空谷 Ondra 的对话编排（手册 §8.5）：会话内冻结前缀——稳定段（人格 + 世界书常驻）在会话开头拼一次就锁死，易变段（日期/情绪）追加尾部，历史只追加不重拼，压缩只在用户回合边界。每轮重拼 system prompt 会让缓存命中率从 99% 掉到 0（实测成本 ¥879.97 → ¥19.96），这是全仓唯一守住那条线的地方。不建 Session、不写 app_session_log、不改写正文、不做注入装箱。",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./src/*": "./src/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "lib/**/*.d.ts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "AGPL-3.0",
  "ondra": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~",
    "@types/node": "22.20.1"
  }
}
